out=dict(schemaVersion='q025-source-journeys/1',purpose='Falsification and navigation acceptance, not an accuracy estimate or a gold taxonomy. Witnesses identify evidence to inspect; they do not prescribe a cluster or prove the scientific claims.',identityRule='Equivalent accepted question prompts resolve to one scoped destination ID across entry routes. Boundary prompts changing target, hypotheses or regime may require distinct linked IDs. Region IDs are never substitutes for canonical question identity.',splitPolicy='Known regressions are development cases. Navigation challenges reuse previously scoped scientific evidence; they are new navigation tests but not new blind scientific adjudications. Do not tune on all challenge answers and call them held out.',cases=cases)
